DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260731T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260731T193000
SUMMARY:Comedy on the River - A Unique Paddle-in Comedy Show! 
DESCRIPTION:Toronto SUP\, Kayak & Canoe Adventures - Meetup Group\n**Come 
 laugh along with us on our unique paddle-in comedy show!** To book your sp
 ot\, please go to the link:\n[https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/
 comedy-shows-on-the-river/](https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/co
 medy-shows-on-the-river/)\n\nLink will show live boat availability and opt
 ions!\n\n**Kayak or Canoe or Standup Paddle Board your way to a Comedy sho
 w right on the Humber River!**\n\nJoin us for laughter-filled evenings wit
 h talented comedians while enjoying the beautiful scenery of the Humber Ri
 ver. Looking to try something truly unique?! Our super popular Comedy On T
 he River paddle in comedy shows are back again for another season!\n\nLoca
 ted on Toronto’s beautiful Humber River our Comedy On The River event st
 arts at our Humber Paddling centre which is only a 5-minute walk from Old 
 Mill TTC Station! Upon arrival\, we’ll get you signed in and set you up 
 with your boat and equipment before you embark on your scenic paddle of th
 e meandering Humber River to our Comedy Show located right on the river! U
 pon arrival you’ll be greeted by host Dan Galea\, and some of Toronto’
 s biggest upcoming comedians!\n\n**Pricing (per boat)\, Payable online thr
 ough:**\n**[https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/comedy-shows-on-th
 e-river/](https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/comedy-shows-on-the-
 river/)**\n\n* Single Kayak (seats 1 person) : $49.95 +taxes\n* Tandem Kay
 ak (seats 2 people) : $89.95 +taxes\n* Regular Canoe (seats 2 people) : $7
 9.95 +taxes\n* Large Canoe (seats 3 people) : $99.95 +taxes\n* Stand Up Pa
 ddleboard (1 person) : $45 +taxes\n* Voyageur Canoe Seat (1 person): $39.9
 5 +taxes\n* Bring Your Own Boat (boat/equipment): $9.95 +taxes\n\n**What's
  Included:**\n\n* Boat(s)\n* Paddle(s)\n* PFD(s) “Lifejackets”\n* A co
 medy show right on the river!\n* Our friendly staff to help you every step
  of the way!\n\n**What to Bring:**\n\n* Dress for the weather!\n* We recom
 mend securely fastened footwear (footwear is not required for SUPs).\n* Bl
 anket to keep you cozy during the show.\n* Snacks & Drinks (Non Alcoholic)
 \n* Government issued photo ID.\n\n**Important Information:**\n\n* Check s
 pecific event dates for start time and duration!\n* Anyone under 18 must b
 e accompanied by an adult or legal guardian.\n* We Start & Finish this eve
 nt at our Humber Location\, so no need for a shuttle.\n* Plan to arrive at
  least 15 minutes early for Check-In to ensure that you get out on time an
 d enjoy the whole show.\n* Waivers to be signed on location.\n* Paddlers m
 ust be comfortable treading water while wearing a PFD and reaching a shore
 line (minimum 20 metres to shore).\n\n**Cancellation & Weather**\n\n* *Eve
 nts are subject to weather and other factors out of our control. Any weath
 er cancellations will be announced through email to booked attendees and o
 n the home page of www.TorontoAdventures.ca.*\n\n**[Cancellation Policy](h
 ttps://torontoadventures.ca/faq/#cancellation)**\n**[Google Link Direction
 s](https://torontoadventures.ca/directions/#humberriverlocation)**
